@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #6E2635
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FAF7F3
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FAF7F3
skinparam roundcorner 10
title UML用例图  用户角色与功能范围
left to right direction
actor 游客 as Guest
actor 普通用户 as Member
actor 买家 as Buyer
actor 卖家 as Seller
actor 管理员 as Admin
actor "超时调度器\n规则待确认" as Timer
Member <|-- Buyer
Member <|-- Seller
rectangle "校园二手交易系统" {
 usecase "浏览与组合查询商品" as Browse
 usecase "注册与登录" as Login
 usecase "保存草稿与提交审核" as Publish
 usecase "修改或下架本人商品" as Edit
 usecase "预约商品与查看预约" as Reserve
 usecase "取消本人待确认预约" as Cancel
 usecase "接受或拒绝预约" as Accept
 usecase "标记线下交付" as Deliver
 usecase "确认完成或提出争议" as Complete
 usecase "举报商品" as Report
 usecase "本人商品与交易统计" as OwnStats
 usecase "审核商品与记录原因" as Review
 usecase "下架或冻结违规商品" as Freeze
 usecase "处理举报与记录争议结果" as Handle
 usecase "查询统计与操作日志" as Audit
 usecase "关闭超时待确认预约" as Expire
}
Guest --> Browse
Guest --> Login
Member --> Browse
Member --> Report
Buyer --> Reserve
Buyer --> Cancel
Buyer --> Complete
Seller --> Publish
Seller --> Edit
Seller --> Accept
Seller --> Deliver
Seller --> OwnStats
Admin --> Review
Admin --> Freeze
Admin --> Handle
Admin --> Audit
Timer --> Expire
note bottom of Member
买家和卖家为同一普通账号的业务身份。
受保护用例要求登录，不将登录画为每次操作必执行的 include。
end note
note bottom of Handle
只记录争议处理结果；不支持强制结案。
不提供支付、物流、站内聊天或申诉用例。
end note
@enduml
